335
00:26:50.109 --> 00:26:52.334
On palju?

336
00:27:01.060 --> 00:27:03.260
Ei leia.

337
00:27:04.900 --> 00:27:07.650
See suve.

338
00:27:07.750 --> 00:27:09.030
Ei.

339
00:27:09.130 --> 00:27:12.120
Loodelennuta.

340
00:27:12.220 --> 00:27:14.345
Siis.

341
00:27:15.130 --> 00:27:17.650
Ette lausa lõputa on see.
